page('01 / Executive summary')
h('Problem and approach')
p('Retail support combines natural-language policy questions with private order facts. The supplied knowledge base deliberately includes outdated and conflicting documents, holiday-aware timelines, category-specific returns and escalation triggers. A helpful answer must be grounded in the correct source and must not bypass identity verification.')
p('ZentroCare separates public policy retrieval from private order access. A word/character TF-IDF index retrieves policy sections. A deterministic conversation controller gates the supplied lookup tool, maintains current-session verification state, and performs selected workflow calculations. Responses preserve evidence IDs for inspection. General answers quote the retrieved sections rather than inventing an approval.')
h('Measured outcomes')
table([['Measure','Result','Interpretation'],['Dataset validation','PASS','Supplied validator: schema, relations and consistency'],['Component tests','18 / 18 pass','Selected rules, privacy regressions, dates and tools'],['Original text Recall@5','70.21%','Macro recall of required policy sections'],['Original text MRR@5','0.6986','First relevant section within five ranked results'],['ASR-like text Recall@5','70.21%','Text robustness only; no audio was processed']],[145,95,260])
h('Conclusion')
p('The prototype demonstrates an auditable text-support foundation with a working local browser interface. It is appropriate as a reproducible capstone baseline, not an autonomous production support system. The evaluation exposes meaningful evidence-retrieval gaps, and multilingual response generation, voice transport, comprehensive conversation validation and deployment security remain future work.')
page('02 / Scope and requirements')
table([['Dataset requirement','Implementation status'],['Ground answers in KB section IDs','Implemented: 82 eligible sections, IDs in responses'],['Respect current vs superseded documents','Implemented filter plus historical rule retained in RET-3'],['Resolve conflicting document authorities','Partial: authority-weighted retrieval; no guaranteed semantic conflict resolver'],['Verify before order disclosure','Implemented for mock lookup; retry gate in active session'],['Selected return and refund calculations','Implemented with fixed date, holiday calendar and category rules'],['Escalate and create a ticket before claiming handover','Implemented for selected keyword/state triggers using supplied tool'],['Hindi / Hinglish and other-language support','Partial synonym expansion; outputs primarily English'],['Gnani WebSocket STT and streaming TTS','Not implemented; no credentials or real audio evaluation'],['52 single questions + 23 conversations','Single-question retrieval evaluated; full conversation benchmark not scored'],['Public GitHub / live demo / portal delivery','Not published or submitted; local deliverables and instructions included']],[220,280])
h('Assumptions and exclusions')
p('No marking rubric, institution-specific report template, student identity, deadline, GitHub account access or voice credentials were supplied. The project therefore prioritizes reproducible offline text support. It performs no real refunds, order cancellations, payment actions or customer communications. All records are explicitly synthetic according to the supplied README.')
page('03 / Dataset understanding and quality')
