p('Additional supplied material: 21 Markdown knowledge documents; 52 practice questions; 96 customer-message turns across 23 conversations; mock tools and the dataset validator.')
p('Primary links: customers.customer_id to orders.customer_id; orders.order_id to order_items.order_id; order_items.sku to products.sku; delivery_pincode to pincodes.pincode. Identifiers are read as strings to preserve leading zeroes and exact refund reference numbers.')
h('Quality checks performed')
