p('<b>Evaluation integrity:</b> Practice labels are loaded only by the evaluator, never by the runtime agent. The supplied practice set informed development checks and the system was revised during development; these are in-sample diagnostic results, not held-out generalization estimates. No end-to-end answer accuracy, tool-call accuracy or 96-turn conversation success is claimed.')
